sequenceDiagram
    participant WF as Workflow primitive
    participant CP as Control Plane
    participant Q as HITL queue (HITLTransportProtocol)
    participant H as Human (via MCP endpoint / ccf hitl CLI)
    participant IdP as IdentityProvider (D-IMPL-21)
    participant RR as Decision Replay record
    participant AS as ArtifactStore

    WF->>WF: reach ApprovalGate node
    WF->>CP: persist WorkflowExecutionState (D-IMPL-18)
    CP->>AS: write execution trace through (suspend point)
    WF->>Q: enqueue pending event (gate id, state ref, Context Product hash, deadline policy)
    Note over WF: suspend (state machine parked at gate)
    Q-->>H: pending approval visible (MCP Resource)
    H->>IdP: authenticate (OIDC/SAML or dev auth context)
    IdP-->>H: HumanPrincipalBinding (subject, auth context, assurance)
    H->>Q: approve + annotations (MCP Tool action)
    Q->>Q: validate action record (extra=forbid, binding required)
    Q->>RR: append HITL action (identity, time, product hash seen, annotations)
    Note over RR: replay write precedes state transition (audit by construction)
    Q->>WF: deliver validated action record
    WF->>CP: load persisted state
    WF->>WF: resume — transition to next node
